text.section:
No later than 90 days after the final determination date, a partnership shall:

File with the Department a completed federal adjustments report, which shall include any information required by the Department;


Notify each direct partner of its distributive share of the final federal adjustments and provide to each direct partner any other information required by the Department;


File an amended composite return pursuant to § 58.1-395 if such return previously was filed on behalf of nonresident partners;


File an amended return pursuant to § 58.1-392; and


Pay any additional amount that may be required pursuant to the provisions of §§ 58.1-395 and 58.1-486.2.
